WEBVTT

00:02.000 --> 00:04.300
shinjitai
I want to believe

00:04.430 --> 00:07.460
ano hi mitsuketa hikari
In the light that I found that day

00:07.970 --> 00:10.710
kimi to kawashita
Because I still have

00:10.710 --> 00:15.340
tatta hitotsuno yakusoku ga arukara
That one promise that I made to you

00:15.780 --> 00:22.740
mou tachidomarazuni aruite yukitai
I want to keep walking, never stopping

00:24.490 --> 00:27.360
Dragon Drive

00:27.360 --> 00:32.850
uresugita kajitsu wo kajiru youni
Like biting into an overripe fruit

00:32.990 --> 00:35.960
yowai jibun ni
I was spoiling myself

00:35.960 --> 00:39.200
amaetsuzukete ita
I was giving in to my weakness

00:39.700 --> 00:44.070
kimi ni deawanakereba
If I hadn't met you

00:44.070 --> 00:46.040
ima mo
I'd still...

00:46.040 --> 00:52.340
kabe wo kowasu koto nado dekinakatta yo
...be unable to break the walls around me

00:54.080 --> 00:56.450
wasurenai
I'll never forget

00:56.450 --> 00:59.650
ano hi kanjita itami
The pain that I felt that day

00:59.990 --> 01:04.990
nido to ano basho modoritakunai
I never want to go back to that place

01:04.990 --> 01:06.550
motto tsuyoku
This strong feeling

01:06.690 --> 01:09.100
shinjitai
I want to believe

01:09.100 --> 01:12.230
ano hi mitsuketa hikari
In the light I found that day

01:12.630 --> 01:17.710
kakkowarui to warawaretemo ii
Let them laugh and call me a loser

01:17.710 --> 01:20.440
bukiyou dakara
Because I'm clumsy

01:20.440 --> 01:28.110
onaji ikikata shika erabenainda
I can only choose to live life this way

01:41.130 --> 01:43.190
Sit back and watch my strength.

01:43.530 --> 01:45.520
So you did come from RI-ON, after all!

01:49.770 --> 01:52.710
You've made it clear that
you're dead serious. However...

01:53.010 --> 01:54.600
So am I.

02:00.780 --> 02:04.080
Give Meguru back to me!

02:06.790 --> 02:08.780
Stop it, Hideaki!

02:15.100 --> 02:16.090
Meguru...

02:21.140 --> 02:24.440
The Four Sacred Dragons

02:32.050 --> 02:34.310
What did you wanna
talk to me about, Elder?

02:34.580 --> 02:36.570
I want you to give Reiji a message.

02:36.920 --> 02:40.250
Do not let RI-ON near
the Shrine of the Four Sacred Dragons.

02:40.620 --> 02:43.820
As long as he's able to do that,
victory will be ours!

02:45.330 --> 02:46.420
Listen carefully.

02:46.630 --> 02:49.430
If RI-ON enters the Shrine
of the Four Sacred Dragons...

02:49.530 --> 02:54.870
...what awaits us is total world destruction.
Everything will end.

02:56.940 --> 02:58.100
Reiji.

03:01.240 --> 03:03.440
Okay, everyone! Are you ready?!

03:03.650 --> 03:07.670
We sure are! We'll arrive at the Shrine
while Kouhei and the others are searching!

03:11.420 --> 03:13.750
Okay then, everyone! Let's...

03:13.820 --> 03:15.620
Wait one moment!!

03:18.030 --> 03:19.290
Rockaku...

03:19.590 --> 03:20.720
And Sayaka.

03:20.800 --> 03:23.130
What are you doing, dampening our spirit?

03:25.970 --> 03:27.590
Rockaku. What about your injuries?

03:27.870 --> 03:29.460
Not a problem!

03:29.540 --> 03:31.230
This is our final battle!

03:31.310 --> 03:34.040
I can't stay in bed
while you guys are battling! Oww...

03:34.180 --> 03:35.300
Rockaku.

03:35.710 --> 03:37.680
Why not go get some more rest?

03:39.510 --> 03:41.310
I had a feeling you'd come, Sayaka.

03:42.980 --> 03:46.510
Well, I may not show it,
but I do worry about everyone.

03:46.790 --> 03:48.480
Huh? Really?

03:48.990 --> 03:50.010
Reiji.

03:50.390 --> 03:52.330
I have a message from the Elder.

03:53.160 --> 03:54.420
From the Elder?

03:54.500 --> 03:56.590
There are two Dragonites.

03:57.800 --> 04:03.240
The Dragonite RI-ON took is the key
to the Shrine of the Four Sacred Dragons.

04:03.570 --> 04:06.900
When the person with the key
enters the Shrine...

04:07.040 --> 04:11.380
...it causes Shinryu, sealed in
the other Dragonite, to awaken.

04:11.650 --> 04:13.980
Should that happen,
this world would come to an end.

04:20.390 --> 04:24.380
The two Dragonites, the key
and the one keeping Shinryu at bay...

04:25.090 --> 04:28.590
As long as they're kept at a distance,
the seal will not be broken.

04:29.030 --> 04:30.050
In other words...

04:30.130 --> 04:32.790
...we're fine as long as we don't let Kouhei
into the Shrine of the Four Sacred Dragons.

04:33.400 --> 04:35.130
If we stop him before he gets to the Shrine...

04:35.200 --> 04:38.500
...it'll also give us an opportunity
to get the key Dragonite back from him.

04:38.840 --> 04:41.270
But I doubt it'll be that simple.

04:41.610 --> 04:43.510
We must stop him no matter what.

04:45.750 --> 04:47.410
It's our only choice.

04:50.180 --> 04:52.280
Okay, guys! Let's go!

04:52.420 --> 04:53.680
It's our final battle!

04:53.760 --> 04:55.220
Let's give it everything we've got!

04:55.290 --> 04:57.720
This coming from the guy
who's the last one to arrive.

04:57.890 --> 04:59.090
Shut up!

04:59.160 --> 05:00.090
Rockaku.

05:00.230 --> 05:01.250
What is it now?!

05:01.760 --> 05:03.200
About that guy.

05:06.630 --> 05:10.230
If that guy comes out to fight,
leave him to us.

05:11.140 --> 05:13.730
You're awfully confident, Reiji.

05:14.010 --> 05:16.240
Huh?! No, I was just...

05:16.440 --> 05:18.280
Don't you worry about anything.

05:18.750 --> 05:22.940
Just get the Dragonite back
and stop Shinryu from resurrecting!

05:23.150 --> 05:25.090
Come on, Rockaku! You're being too harsh!

05:25.190 --> 05:27.180
Reiji's just worried about you!

05:28.520 --> 05:32.930
I've really lost it,
to have you guys worry about me!

05:35.800 --> 05:37.990
Sorry, Reiji, Maiko.

05:39.230 --> 05:41.260
Once we're done with this battle...

05:41.940 --> 05:42.930
Rockaku.

05:43.470 --> 05:44.940
Exactly!

05:45.070 --> 05:47.370
Once we're done with this,
we'll have a match against each other!

05:47.440 --> 05:48.430
Huh?!

05:48.580 --> 05:51.600
I've always wanted to have
a proper match against you, Rockaku!

05:51.950 --> 05:56.320
Not only you, but against Daisuke,
Mr. Taiyou, and Ichirou as well.

05:56.420 --> 05:58.750
I wanna have a real battle
against each of you.

05:58.820 --> 05:59.790
That's why...

06:00.390 --> 06:03.920
We'll end this battle,
and all return here, and...

06:04.360 --> 06:05.850
Yeah! I accept your challenge!

06:05.930 --> 06:09.290
I'll make you regret ever saying
that you want to fight against me!

06:09.660 --> 06:11.630
Let's return safely, okay, Rockaku?

06:11.930 --> 06:13.420
Of course!

06:21.910 --> 06:24.430
Those guys have finally left.

06:25.280 --> 06:29.480
It must've been hard for you to sit still
with that gorilla man within sight, Mahiru.

06:29.780 --> 06:31.270
You were very patient.

06:31.520 --> 06:34.180
- Now, it's time to go and kick ass.
- Right.

06:34.490 --> 06:36.550
Do you have a problem with my strategy?

06:38.290 --> 06:39.490
We had no choice.

06:39.560 --> 06:42.320
We don't know where
the Dragons' Graveyard is.

06:42.700 --> 06:44.760
We're better off having them
show us the way.

06:45.300 --> 06:46.820
Stop giving me orders!

06:50.710 --> 06:52.370
What do you not like about it?

06:52.440 --> 06:55.770
What Father wants is a perfect ending!

06:56.240 --> 06:58.180
Father, you say?

06:58.280 --> 06:59.250
Mhm.

06:59.550 --> 07:01.950
Saizou Toki hates halfhearted approaches.

07:02.420 --> 07:03.650
You know that.

07:06.320 --> 07:07.840
Reinforcements?

07:08.060 --> 07:10.250
What do you take me for, Dad?

07:11.260 --> 07:13.350
I admit, I made a mistake the last time.

07:13.590 --> 07:17.760
But I don't believe I'm so dimwitted
as to make the same mistake twice.

07:18.600 --> 07:22.090
Or is it that you can't trust
Light Night's Knight and me?

07:22.200 --> 07:24.870
I'll end this game right away
if that's what you desire.

07:24.970 --> 07:25.940
Kouhei.

07:26.070 --> 07:26.970
What is it?

07:27.810 --> 07:30.970
You don't understand
the importance of all this.

07:32.610 --> 07:33.710
You sure?

07:35.420 --> 07:37.580
The world is about to perish.

07:38.620 --> 07:42.680
Even as we speak,
this world is slowly decomposing.

07:43.120 --> 07:44.720
What are you talking about?

07:49.060 --> 07:51.550
We cannot afford to fail.

07:53.230 --> 07:56.900
Everything's fine as long as I bring back
the real Dragonite, right?!

07:57.070 --> 07:59.040
Then I'll do it for you, Dad.

07:59.270 --> 08:02.240
So don't do anything
to dampen my efforts, okay?!

08:02.910 --> 08:04.430
There are no changes to the initial plan!

08:04.650 --> 08:09.310
As I've instructed,
you are to bring Shinryu back from Rikyu.

08:10.020 --> 08:12.490
Your younger brother will go to Rikyu
shortly after you return there.

08:12.750 --> 08:13.910
Younger brother?

08:14.160 --> 08:16.890
He will be there
to relay my thoughts to you.

08:19.930 --> 08:21.190
Damn you, Dad.

08:23.130 --> 08:26.260
Let's work together on this,
for Father's sake!

08:30.510 --> 08:31.940
Wait up, will you?!

08:33.310 --> 08:35.540
What in the world are they doing?

08:36.380 --> 08:39.540
Well, not that it matters to me.

08:41.180 --> 08:42.150
Rockaku.

08:43.280 --> 08:44.770
Our next battle will be the decisive battle.

08:51.260 --> 08:56.320
Why must we come through this area
on our way to an important battle?

09:03.870 --> 09:07.240
I must first do something about Mahiru.

09:09.810 --> 09:12.680
Why must I go, too?

09:12.780 --> 09:15.250
I dislike battles.

09:15.920 --> 09:18.220
I'll leave the fighting to the rest of them.

09:18.620 --> 09:21.610
I'll join them once things have settled down.

09:22.520 --> 09:24.080
Huh? Sayaka?

09:25.190 --> 09:27.520
Boy. What is it with that lady?

09:29.630 --> 09:30.820
Kyoji!

09:31.130 --> 09:33.690
You guys go ahead! I'll bring her back!

09:39.140 --> 09:41.630
Those two can be so self-centered.

09:41.880 --> 09:44.110
Damn it! I'll go and get 'em!

09:44.610 --> 09:46.010
Don't be such a drag!

09:46.250 --> 09:48.150
Come on, Daisuke! Don't get in my way!

09:48.750 --> 09:52.080
They've always been together, after all.

09:52.620 --> 09:54.610
I thought they had something going on!

10:01.100 --> 10:02.320
Hey.

10:02.400 --> 10:04.490
What a sudden and complete
change in atmosphere.

10:04.830 --> 10:06.300
- Reiji.
- Huh?

10:13.910 --> 10:16.270
I remember this place.

10:17.110 --> 10:20.600
Who would've thought the Shrine
of the Four Sacred Dragons would be here?

10:20.750 --> 10:23.440
Do you know this place, Reiji?

10:24.190 --> 10:25.780
Know this place?

10:25.850 --> 10:28.980
Why, it was the first place
we set foot in Rikyu.

10:29.420 --> 10:30.390
Yes.

10:30.560 --> 10:33.860
This is the location where we called over
Reiji, Maiko, and Daisuke...

10:34.030 --> 10:35.120
...with the help of Jigen Joker.

10:42.700 --> 10:45.370
Ow, ow, ow...

10:48.810 --> 10:52.710
Jigen Joker's powers reached maximum
here at the Dragons' Graveyard.

10:53.280 --> 10:56.910
I didn't notice it at the time,
but maybe...

10:57.520 --> 10:59.280
Maybe what?

10:59.350 --> 11:02.480
Maybe Shinryu's powers
affected Jigen Joker's abilities.

11:02.620 --> 11:05.490
Ridiculous! Shinryu's sealed away, right?!

11:05.890 --> 11:07.790
Shinryu's desperately trying to awaken...

11:07.860 --> 11:11.090
...in order to destroy the two worlds,
Earth and Rikyu.

11:11.600 --> 11:13.860
We won't let Shinryu reawaken
no matter what!

11:13.930 --> 11:16.370
That's right! That's why we're here!

11:16.840 --> 11:17.800
Meguru.

11:18.610 --> 11:21.200
I'll be sure to take you
back to Earth with me.

11:21.280 --> 11:23.330
That's why I'm here.

11:24.110 --> 11:27.310
Ichirou. Thank you.

11:31.650 --> 11:33.380
The time is drawing near.

11:33.750 --> 11:37.280
Soon, the world will return
to its proper state.

11:56.640 --> 11:58.130
L. It's me.

11:59.810 --> 12:02.310
S. What's the latest?

12:03.020 --> 12:05.080
Everything's running smoothly.

12:05.590 --> 12:08.150
We'll be entering the final stage
any moment now.

12:08.460 --> 12:10.360
S. Let me out of here.

12:10.890 --> 12:13.360
I can't let this operation proceed.

12:13.760 --> 12:14.920
I can't do that.

12:15.660 --> 12:17.490
I don't wanna end up
being thrown in here as well.

12:17.870 --> 12:19.660
Please, S.

12:21.940 --> 12:24.300
Well, this'll give you a chance
to cool your head.

12:24.840 --> 12:26.200
I'll help you when the time's right.

12:31.480 --> 12:32.670
Meguru.

12:38.520 --> 12:40.510
What's L so afraid of?

12:41.290 --> 12:44.190
Is there something going on within RI-ON
that I don't know about?

12:52.970 --> 12:53.930
Meguru.

12:54.240 --> 12:56.860
It's just past here, to the north.

12:56.940 --> 12:59.910
That's where you'll find
the Shrine of the Four Sacred Dragons.

13:00.210 --> 13:03.730
This place is really spooky
with all these bones all over the place.

13:03.910 --> 13:05.440
It is a graveyard, after all.

13:05.780 --> 13:07.300
We may come across some of 'em.

13:07.410 --> 13:08.850
C-Come across what?!

13:08.980 --> 13:11.420
Ghosts of the dragons!

13:12.720 --> 13:14.420
There's no such thing!

13:14.490 --> 13:16.510
Then what's that behind you?

13:17.360 --> 13:18.420
A GHOST!!

13:23.700 --> 13:26.330
I'm not scared. I'm not scared.
They don't exist...

13:30.570 --> 13:32.330
That was a joke! A joke!

13:32.710 --> 13:35.330
You're a real scaredy-cat, Daisuke.

13:35.510 --> 13:38.070
Is there anyone who isn't scared of ghosts?

13:38.150 --> 13:39.910
Well, you have a point there!

13:42.620 --> 13:45.350
How dare you make me look bad
in front of my sweet honey.

13:45.650 --> 13:47.590
I'll get you for this, Rockaku.

13:47.890 --> 13:51.090
This is not the time for jokes,
think of the situation we're in!

13:51.430 --> 13:56.160
Isn't it sad to have to rely on those guys?

13:56.360 --> 13:58.960
Cheer up already, Daisuke!

13:59.030 --> 14:00.630
Unless you learn to relax...

14:00.700 --> 14:02.830
...you won't be able to rely on your strengths
when you need them.

14:03.040 --> 14:05.160
I promise never to scare you like that again!

14:05.240 --> 14:06.830
- Okay? I'm sorry. I apologize.
- I can't leave things as is!

14:06.910 --> 14:09.270
- I'm very, very sorry!
- Unless I somehow restore my image...

14:09.340 --> 14:12.780
...My sweet honey will never lean
toward me again for the rest of my life!

14:16.680 --> 14:20.090
Then I'll take on any enemy,
whether it's Kouhei...

14:20.150 --> 14:21.590
...or the Four Sacred Dragons or the Shrine!

14:21.660 --> 14:23.890
I'm prepared to take them all on alone!

14:28.930 --> 14:30.620
Huh? It's a dead end.

14:30.800 --> 14:31.990
Which way from here, Meguru?

14:32.070 --> 14:33.190
That's funny.

14:33.330 --> 14:35.960
There was no such cliff
the last time I was here.

14:36.300 --> 14:37.700
Did I make a mistake somewhere?

14:38.010 --> 14:39.730
What now? We taking a break?

14:39.810 --> 14:41.970
What's the matter? Are we lost?

14:42.640 --> 14:44.410
I don't think I made any mistake!

14:44.580 --> 14:46.710
This should be the right way!

14:48.820 --> 14:51.550
Given this fog, I wouldn't be surprised
if anybody got lost.

14:51.620 --> 14:53.990
Let's look around the area.

14:55.360 --> 14:58.190
Why don't we split up
into smaller groups and search?

14:58.430 --> 15:02.260
Are you sure? You won't be scared
roaming around here alone?

15:02.330 --> 15:03.990
Shut up, Rockaku!

15:04.060 --> 15:05.930
What'll we do if Kouhei passes us...

15:06.000 --> 15:08.160
...while we're sitting here
wondering how to get there?!

15:08.400 --> 15:11.630
But Meguru's the only one
who knows the area.

15:11.810 --> 15:14.770
I believe we'd be better off
proceeding very cautiously.

15:14.910 --> 15:16.770
Then you guys stay here!

15:17.010 --> 15:19.810
Kanper and I will go
and find the Shrine for you!

15:19.880 --> 15:21.250
Stop, Daisuke!

15:21.580 --> 15:22.780
Don't stop me, Reiji!

15:23.250 --> 15:24.770
We mustn't get separated!

15:24.850 --> 15:27.080
We cannot beat Kouhei
unless we stick together!

15:29.020 --> 15:30.420
I believe in Meguru!

15:31.230 --> 15:32.850
In the end, that's really our only choice.

15:32.930 --> 15:33.890
You're right.

15:33.960 --> 15:34.930
Daisuke.

15:35.100 --> 15:36.720
Let's look for the Shrine together, okay?

15:37.460 --> 15:38.430
Maiko.

15:38.870 --> 15:39.990
Fine, then!

15:40.070 --> 15:41.360
I'll look for it together with you guys!

15:41.440 --> 15:43.490
Don't worry! I know we'll find it!

15:44.140 --> 15:46.800
Huh? I thought they'd get into a fight.

15:46.870 --> 15:49.170
Take a look at that "friendship power"!

15:49.280 --> 15:52.940
But I'm getting bored staying by those guys.

15:53.280 --> 15:56.550
I sure hope they'll make
their next move soon.

15:56.680 --> 15:57.650
The Dragonite.

15:58.120 --> 15:58.910
What?

15:58.990 --> 16:01.980
If nothing will happen,
why don't you make something happen?

16:02.360 --> 16:06.050
If you use the Dragonite here,
it could trigger something.

16:06.360 --> 16:08.390
- Based on what grounds?
- Nothing.

16:08.460 --> 16:09.660
What the hell?!

16:09.730 --> 16:12.700
Trying something that random
is just a waste of time!

16:12.970 --> 16:14.870
Are you going against me?

16:15.100 --> 16:17.660
Have you forgotten what Father said?

16:21.740 --> 16:24.910
Would you cut it out
with the "Father said this, Father said that"?

16:26.750 --> 16:28.870
You sure something's gonna happen?

16:30.750 --> 16:33.910
Don't blame me
if it doesn't go like you want it to!

16:42.430 --> 16:43.660
What is it, Chibi?

16:44.430 --> 16:45.830
Lai-Lai Cocoon?

16:46.230 --> 16:48.760
They seem to be sensing something.

16:48.840 --> 16:50.740
I don't sense anything.

16:54.840 --> 16:56.640
Hey, look above!

16:57.380 --> 16:59.970
The Shrine must be in that direction!

17:00.050 --> 17:01.880
You were right all along!

17:03.680 --> 17:06.350
Okay! Let's go, everyone!

17:16.960 --> 17:18.330
Yes! This is the place!

17:18.400 --> 17:20.960
Inside those clouds is
the Shrine of the Four Sacred Dragons!

17:21.840 --> 17:23.130
In the clouds?

17:23.340 --> 17:24.300
Yes.

17:24.440 --> 17:27.600
In the clouds is an island
where the Shrine is located.

17:27.740 --> 17:30.370
Island? Okay, let's go!

17:43.820 --> 17:46.490
That's the Shrine of the Four Sacred Dragons.

17:46.930 --> 17:48.260
We've finally located it.

17:48.930 --> 17:51.420
So Shinryu is sealed in here.

17:51.530 --> 17:52.760
The time has come.

17:53.130 --> 17:54.000
Reiji!

17:54.070 --> 17:55.500
Mhm. I feel it.

17:55.600 --> 17:57.540
Something really awful.

17:57.770 --> 17:59.760
Okay! Let's go, Reiji!

17:59.940 --> 18:01.270
Wait, Daisuke!

18:01.380 --> 18:02.240
What?!

18:02.310 --> 18:04.300
Why should we have to wait,
after coming all the way here?!

18:04.510 --> 18:06.000
Take a good look!

18:14.420 --> 18:18.360
Are these the four dragons
Meguru says assaulted her?

18:18.560 --> 18:21.790
Yeah. People are attacked
when trying to get inside.

18:21.860 --> 18:23.260
Right, Meguru?

18:24.160 --> 18:26.290
If that's the case, I think we shouldn't go in.

18:26.370 --> 18:29.530
I think we should face Kouhei
out here when he arrives.

18:29.970 --> 18:31.800
Why do such a roundabout thing?

18:31.970 --> 18:34.940
We should simply go in to the Shrine...

18:35.010 --> 18:36.940
...and get the stone that has Shinryu in it!

18:37.310 --> 18:39.750
Once we do that,
we'll have the upper hand against Kouhei!

18:39.980 --> 18:42.610
Yeah, but what about
the Four Sacred Dragons?!

18:42.820 --> 18:44.910
There are four of them against six of us!

18:45.220 --> 18:46.550
We can't lose!

18:46.950 --> 18:48.680
Go!! Kanper!!

18:49.420 --> 18:53.120
I'll be the first to get my hands
on the real Dragonite!

18:55.530 --> 18:57.790
I'll just force my way through this!

19:03.440 --> 19:05.770
He's trying to get in without the key.

19:06.110 --> 19:07.730
Full credits for the effort.

19:08.040 --> 19:09.030
Now then...

19:09.110 --> 19:11.670
Now that they've brought us here,
they're no longer anything more than pests.

19:12.110 --> 19:13.740
Why don't we get rid of 'em?

19:14.410 --> 19:15.570
What's wrong?

19:15.850 --> 19:17.820
Getting cold feet with our goal in sight?

19:17.890 --> 19:18.850
That's not it.

19:18.920 --> 19:21.350
Father's telling us to wait a little longer.

19:21.590 --> 19:23.890
Huh? It's not as if you can hear him.

19:24.460 --> 19:28.620
Those who break the seal
anger the Four Sacred Dragons, and perish.

19:29.900 --> 19:32.390
Those people will be attacked
by the Four Sacred Dragons.

19:32.870 --> 19:35.300
You even know stuff like that?

19:36.000 --> 19:37.970
Father tells me.

19:38.070 --> 19:40.270
Didn't he ever teach you such things?

19:43.080 --> 19:45.410
You keep getting on my nerves!

19:48.520 --> 19:49.740
Don't touch me!

19:49.920 --> 19:51.480
Damn you!

19:51.920 --> 19:53.220
Please stop it, Daisuke!

19:53.850 --> 19:56.020
J-Just a bit more.

19:56.360 --> 19:59.050
A bit more, and victory's ours.

20:02.600 --> 20:04.830
No. You mustn't...

20:05.600 --> 20:07.400
You mustn't open the... Shrine...

20:09.500 --> 20:11.970
I'm the first one here at the Shrine
of the Four Sacred Dragons!

20:12.040 --> 20:14.300
Sorry! It's not that simple!

20:14.370 --> 20:15.340
Huh?!

20:17.480 --> 20:18.500
Kouhei!

20:19.810 --> 20:20.610
Mahiru.

20:20.750 --> 20:24.210
Maiko, Ichirou,
go to the Shrine with Daisuke!

20:24.450 --> 20:25.780
We'll stay here and stop Kouhei!

20:25.890 --> 20:27.550
- All right!
- Leave it to us!

20:27.690 --> 20:29.660
We won't let them into the Shrine, right?

20:29.720 --> 20:31.160
Let's go, Chibi!

20:32.360 --> 20:33.660
See you later, Rockaku!

20:33.730 --> 20:34.660
Hey! Wait!

20:34.800 --> 20:37.090
I'm sick and tired of your faces!

20:39.400 --> 20:40.370
Rockaku!

20:40.430 --> 20:41.990
- Don't get in my way!
- Reiji!

20:42.100 --> 20:43.160
Stay outta this!

20:43.240 --> 20:45.760
Rockaku! I'll fight this guy!

20:45.910 --> 20:47.670
You go after Kouhei!

20:48.080 --> 20:49.540
I'm telling you to stay outta this!

20:49.610 --> 20:51.170
This guy's my problem!

20:51.580 --> 20:54.070
Rockaku! I'll end things for you today!

20:54.480 --> 20:58.010
Mahiru! I'm busy!
Let's hurry up and get started!

20:58.090 --> 20:59.110
You're on!

20:59.190 --> 21:00.380
You mustn't, Rockaku!

21:11.730 --> 21:13.130
They've awakened.

21:13.300 --> 21:14.700
The Four Sacred Dragons.

21:14.770 --> 21:15.740
What?

21:20.270 --> 21:22.610
The true terror is about to begin.

21:24.110 --> 21:26.170
I told them to wait, but they wouldn't listen.

21:30.150 --> 21:31.550
What's going on?!

21:32.520 --> 21:33.710
They're coming!

21:40.560 --> 21:42.820
Things are beginning to get very interesting.

21:56.680 --> 21:59.340
taikutsu datta
I was bored

21:59.410 --> 22:02.110
okubyou datta
I was a coward

22:02.180 --> 22:06.120
dareka wo jibun wo kizutsukete ita
I was hurting someone and myself

22:07.590 --> 22:10.280
tsuyogari itte
I tried to hide my weakness

22:10.360 --> 22:12.520
wagamama itte
I was being selfish

22:12.990 --> 22:17.090
doushiyoumonai kimochi mamoritsuzukete
Protecting the uncontrollable feeling

22:18.530 --> 22:21.130
otona ni natte
I became an adult

22:21.200 --> 22:23.860
kimi to deatte
Then I met you

22:23.940 --> 22:27.900
mune no sumikko yawarakaku natte
My heart got softened

22:29.240 --> 22:31.680
setsunaku natta
Longing for love

22:31.750 --> 22:34.680
dakishime atta
We embraced each other

22:34.750 --> 22:39.620
hakkiri mamorubeki mono wo mitsuketa
I finally knew what I wanted to protect

22:40.290 --> 22:42.950
tatta hitotsu no yuuki ga
Only one courage

22:43.020 --> 22:45.720
tatta hitotsu no kotoba ga
Just one word

22:45.790 --> 22:50.420
futari owaranai yume e to hakobu
Take us to an endless dream

22:51.160 --> 22:53.860
hon no chiisana yasashisa ga
Only a small kindness

22:53.930 --> 22:56.530
hon no wazuka na sasayaki ga
Only a small whisper

22:56.600 --> 23:01.230
futari wo sotto tsutsunde kureru
Wrap us gently

23:01.910 --> 23:06.400
zutto konomama asa ga kurumade
Until the morning comes

23:07.350 --> 23:13.010
zutto konomama asa ga kurumade
Until the morning comes

23:15.390 --> 23:18.050
Next time

23:19.360 --> 23:21.730
So they're the rumored Four Sacred Dragons?

23:21.800 --> 23:23.820
Okay, let's put our strengths together and...

23:23.900 --> 23:25.160
...or so I thought...

23:25.230 --> 23:27.670
...but Rockaku and Mahiru's
misunderstanding grows worse...

23:27.770 --> 23:29.830
...and Daisuke's gone
on an uncontrollable rampage!

23:29.900 --> 23:32.840
- We're in trouble!
- Just then, the silhouette of a person...

23:32.910 --> 23:33.530
What?!

23:33.610 --> 23:35.600
That icy glare...
that cool stance...

23:35.680 --> 23:37.170
...why, you're!

23:37.610 --> 23:40.100
Next, on Dragon Drive, "Rival".

23:40.280 --> 23:42.340
Oh, boy! What's happened to his dragon?!

23:42.420 --> 23:44.790
Rival
Transformation!

23:44.790 --> 23:45.080
Rival
